<title>UK: Cerinvest sets $75 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Cerinvest sets $75 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Kredietbank and Cera Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CERINVEST</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CERABANK</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    02.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.375   PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100.1875  SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  1-10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY DUE AUG 1999 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
